1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19950, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0154gqzyYSEuSjGaKGSQkUGj", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19950, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_014TGGmTQNLCurfHsUNja6vF", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20250, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_014TGGmTQNLCurfHsUNja6vF", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20250, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_014TGGmTQNLCurfHsUNja6vF", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 24677, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NjuLDrcsfsEHq7CQvaf7kt", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout in all regions. After the rollback: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures and the orchestrator error that stopped the rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55277, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NjuLDrcsfsEHq7CQvaf7kt", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55277, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NjuLDrcsfsEHq7CQvaf7kt", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57020, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01PMbZ5WtQeTkXo8jcTWNryW", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57320, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01PMbZ5WtQeTkXo8jcTWNryW", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57320, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01PMbZ5WtQeTkXo8jcTWNryW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62480, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks. I've opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **What was wrong:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The v2.3.1 test build had also failed in staging.\n- **What happened:** the first rollback stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all regions.\n- **Now:** every region is on v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api)**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created anyway, so I didn't send it again. That means on-call was paged once, not twice.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the stalled first attempt), the current healthy state and two follow-ups:\n  - finding out why v2.3.1 fails\n  - finding out what caused the deployment-system error", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JiQTtyrkfPhK1XnyRg1AVD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01K5a75EzWUDTes6DcunNMvq", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01XCA9FQZgtyEWKDDXApD2aQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01HFcn8Ex5g7XbmVMosruUbk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway through: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Retrying the same rollback is safe because it targets the same version, so I'll try once more.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_013NvpGXoaEhPFt23YSHKetJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0154gqzyYSEuSjGaKGSQkUGj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014TGGmTQNLCurfHsUNja6vF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NjuLDrcsfsEHq7CQvaf7kt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2014 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an error rate of ~18%. v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging. Rolled back all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt failed partway (orchestrator error after us-east), which left the regions on mixed versions. A retry finished the rollout in all regions. After the rollback: all regions are on v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is ~0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failures and the orchestrator error that stopped the rollout.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01PMbZ5WtQeTkXo8jcTWNryW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks. I've opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n**Rollback**\n- **What was wrong:** the latest release, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with about 18% of requests erroring.\n- **Version chosen:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy in production. The v2.3.1 test build had also failed in staging.\n- **What happened:** the first rollback stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all regions.\n- **Now:** every region is on v2.3.0, the service is healthy and the error rate is about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api)**\n- The request to create it timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created anyway, so I didn't send it again. That means on-call was paged once, not twice.\n- The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the stalled first attempt), the current healthy state and two follow-ups:\n  - finding out why v2.3.1 fails\n  - finding out what caused the deployment-system error", "type": "text"}]}]}